## 应当代理的苹果服务
## 仅包含 Apple API 与 Apple News；在大陆无 CDN 的域名（上游 default_rule 段）不在此列，交由主配置最终 PROXY 兜底
## 含 apple.com 兜底规则，须在 apple_direct.list 之后引用
## 参见 https://github.com/geekdada/surge-list/blob/master/surgio-snippet/apple.tpl
## 相关域名作用说明 https://support.apple.com/zh-cn/101555
## 最后更新 2026-11-15
## Surge

#
# 一些 com.apple.appstored* 会连接的 API（优先级高）
#
DOMAIN,apps.apple.com
DOMAIN,xp.apple.com
DOMAIN,bag.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,api-edge.apps.apple.com
DOMAIN,api.apps.apple.com
DOMAIN,play.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,se.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,se-edge.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,su.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,upp.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,beta.music.apple.com
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,buy.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,itunes-apple.com.akadns.net

#
# Apple Intelligence
#
DOMAIN,apple-relay.apple.com
DOMAIN,guzzoni.apple.com

#
# Apple News
#
USER-AGENT,AppleNews*
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple.news
DOMAIN,news-events.apple.com
DOMAIN,news-edge.apple.com
DOMAIN,apple.comscoreresearch.com

